<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">RRK49.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">ABAGALATIA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ebaruha ei Paulo yaahandiikiire Abagalatia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Abagalatia</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gal</para>
  <para style="mt2">EBARUHA EI PAULO YAAHANDIIKIIRE</para>
  <para style="mt1">ABAGALATIA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 1:11">Gal 1:11</ref>, <ref loc="GAL 1:12">12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Paulo entumwa, etaratumirwe bantu, kandi etareetsirwe muntu, kureka eyaatumirwe Yesu Kristo na Ruhanga Ishe owaamuzoire omu bafu, <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />nyowe n'ab'eishe-emwe boona abu nyine twabahandiikira imwe ab'amakanisa g'omuri Galatia.<verse eid="GAL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Nimbendeza embabazi n'obusingye ebirikuruga ahari Ruhanga Isheboona na Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo, <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 2:6">1 Tim 2:6</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 5:19">1 Yoh 5:19</ref>. </char></note> owaayehaireyo ahabw'ebibi byaitu, ngu atujune omu busingye obubi oburiho, nka Ruhanga waitu kandi Tataitwe oku asiima; <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />aheebwe ekitiinisa ebiro n'ebiro. Amiina.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abagalatia okwita enaama y'engiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Ntangaariire oku murahukire kuruga ahari Ogwo owaabeetsire ahabw'embabazi za Kristo, mukaikiriza engiri etari nka i mwabandize kwikiriza; <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:24">Byak 15:24</ref>. </char></note> ti habw'okugira ngu hariho endiijo ngiri; kureka hariho abantu abarikubarabanisamu, nibenda kuhindura engiri ya Kristo okundi. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Kwonka ku haakugira owaababuurira engiri etari nka i twababuuriire, yaaba itwe n'obu yaakuba maraika orugire omu iguru, akyeenwe. <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Nk'oku twagambire ira, na hati nikwo ndikugamba nti: Omuntu weena orikubabuurira endiijo ngiri etari i mwaikiriize, akyeenwe. <verse eid="GAL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 2:4">1 Tes 2:4</ref>. </char></note> Nimugira ngu niinyenda kusiimwa abantu nari okusiimwa Ruhanga? Nari shi, ninteeraho kushemeza abantu? Kuri noogira ngu ninkishemeza abantu, tinkubaire muhuuku wa Kristo.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okuhamya okwetwa kwe ku kutari kw'abantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />B'eishe-emwe, nimbamanyisa nti, engiri ei naabuuriire ti y'abantu; <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />ahakuba tindagihairwe muntu, kandi tindagyegyesiibwe, kureka nkagishuuruurirwa Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="GAL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Nimpamya ngu mukahurira aha by'emitwarize yangye eya ira omu diini ey'Abayudaaya, oku naarengyesereize kuhiiga ekanisa ya Ruhanga, ngu ngiihireho kimwe; <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:3">Byak 22:3</ref>. </char></note> kandi nkahingurana omu diini y'Abayudaaya, n'okukira naakira baingi abu naanyetsire nabo omu ihanga ryangye, nyine obweziriki bwingi munonga bw'okugumya emigyenzo ya baatatenkuru. <verse eid="GAL 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:5">Yer 1:5</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Ruhanga owaantooraine nkiri omunda ya maawe, akanyeta ahabw'embabazi ze, <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />ku yaasiimire kunshuuruurira Omwana we ngu mmurangye omu Banyamahanga, ahonaaho tindeehanwize ha bantu nyabuntu, <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />n'obu kwakuba okwinamuka Yerusaalemu kwehanuuza aha ntumwa ezambandiize, kureka nkaza omuri Buharabu; bwanyima naagaruka Damasiko.<verse eid="GAL 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 9:26">Byak 9:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku haahingwireho emyaka eshatu, nainamuka Yerusaalemu kureeba Keefa, naamara nawe ebiro ikumi na bitaano. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:55">Mat 13:55</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka omu zindi ntumwa tiinyine i naareebire kureka Yakobo murumuna wa Mukama waitu. <verse eid="GAL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Ebyo ebi naabahandiikira, nindahira omu maisho ga Ruhanga, tindikubeiha. <verse eid="GAL 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:30">Byak 9:30</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima naaza omu mashaza ga Siria na Kilikia. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Kandi omu biro ebyo amakanisa ga Kristo ag'omuri Buyudaaya gakaba gatakandeebire; <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />kwonka bakaba nibahurira buhurizi abarikugira bati: Omuntu ogwo owaabaire naatuhiiga ira, hati naabuurira eby'ediini ei yaabaire ayenda kuhwerekyereza. <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Baahimbisa Ruhanga ahabwangye.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s1">Paulo okuhamya ku yaatumiirwe Abanyamahanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 15:2">Byak 15:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima ku haahingwireho emyaka ikumi n'ena, naagaruka nainamuka Yerusaalemu na Barunaba, naatwara na Tito. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Nainamukayo ahabw'ebi naashuururiirwe; naabashobororera engiri ei mbuurira omu Banyamahanga, kwonka omu mubonano aha baabaire nibasiimwa ahabw'obukuru, ngu ndekye kushusha nk'orikwirukira busha, nari nk'owairukiire busha. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:3">Byak 16:3</ref>. </char></note> Nangwa na Tito ou twagyendaine, n'obu araabe ari Omugriika, taragyemirwe kusharwa. <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />Kwonka hakaba hariho ab'eishe-emwe ab'ebishuba, abaataahire omuriitwe bwesherekye kutata obusingye bwaitu obu twine omuri Kristo Yesu, ngu batugarure omu buhuuku. <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />Abo tituraboorobeire nangwa n'akaingana busha, ngu amazima g'engiri gabone kurindwa ahabwanyu. <verse eid="GAL 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Kandi abo abaabaire nibasiimwa ngu ni bakuru oku baabaire bari ira, ebyo timbyetaireho; Ruhanga tashoroora mu bantu ahabw'obuganzi abakuru abo tibaine ki baanyongyeireho, <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:15">Byak 9:15</ref>. </char></note> kureka bakeetegyereza ku naakwatsiibwe engiri kugibuurira Abanyamahanga, nk'oku Petero yaagikwatsiibwe kugibuurira abashazirwe. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />(Mumanye ngu Owabaasize Petero kuba entumwa aha bashazirwe, naanye niwe yambaasize kuba entumwa aha Banyamahanga.) <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Ku baayetegyereize omugisha ogu naahairwe, Yakobo na Keefa na Yohaana, abaabire nibasiimwa kuba enyomyo, baatuha omukono gwa buryo, nyowe na Barunaba, okworeka ku bakwataniise naitwe, ngu itwe tugyenda omu Banyamahanga, nabo omu bashazirwe; <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:30">Byak 11:30</ref>. </char></note> kureka eki baatushabire ni kimwe, n'okwijuka abooro; kandi ekyo naanye nkaba nkyezirikiire kukikora.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oburyarya bwa ba Petero okwenda kutaanisa ekanisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Kwonka Keefa ku yaahikire Antiokia, naamuhakanisiza kimwe nitureebana, ahakuba akaba ashobize butunu. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:3">Byak 11:3</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba abaatumirwe Yakobo batakaizire, akaba naarya n'Abanyamahanga; kwonka ku baizire, yaayehinya, yaabeecwaho ahabw'okutiina abashazirwe. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Kandi n'Abayudaaya abandi baamutooreza, baakwatanisa nawe omu buryarya, nangwa na Barunaba nawe yaatwarwa obwo buryarya bwabo. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Kwonka ku naareebire bataakuratira mazima g'engiri, naagambira Petero omu maisho ga boona nti: Iwe ku oraabe nootwaza nk'Abanyamahanga, etari mitwarize y'ekiyudaaya, haza ori Omuyudaaya, ahabw'enki noogyema Abanyamahanga kutwaza nk'Abayudaaya? <verse eid="GAL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />Itwe n'obu turaabe turi Abayudaaya enzaarwa, tutari basiisi b'Abanyamahanga, <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:10">Byak 15:10</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 15:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 3:20">Rom 3:20</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 3:28">28</ref>. </char></note> nitumanya ngu omuntu taihwaho rubanja habw'okuhikiiriza Ebiragiro, kureka ahabw'okwikiriza Yesu Kristo; kandi naitwe tukaikiriza Kristo Yesu, ngu tubone kwihwaho orubanja ahabw'okwikiriza Kristo, kunu ti habw'okuhikiiriza Ebiragiro; ahabw'okuba tihariho muntu weena oihwaho orubanja ahabw'okuhikiiriza Ebiragiro. <verse eid="GAL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Kwonka, ku turaabe twayenzire kwihwaho orubanja omuri Kristo, kandi tukashangwa turi abasiisi, mbwenu shi nimugira ngu Kristo naakwatsiza ekibi? Rubuuza! <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Ahakuba ku ngaruka kwombeka ebi naasheenyire, mba nyeyorekire ku ndi omusiisi. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Ahakuba nyowe ahabw'Ebiragiro nkafa aha Biragiro, ngu mbone kuba ohuriire ahari Ruhanga. <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:23">Yoh 17:23</ref>. </char></note> Nkabambwa na Kristo; tinkiri nyowe ori, kureka Kristo niwe ari omuriinye; kandi amagara agu nyine omu mubiri ngaine ahabw'okwikiriza Omwana wa Ruhanga, owankunzire akeehayo ahabwangye. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Tindikuhindura busha mbabazi za Ruhanga; ahakuba kuri okwihwaho orubanja kuheebwa ahabw'okuhikiiriza Ebiragiro, Kristo akaabaire afeereire busha.<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s1">Omutaano gw'Ebiragiro n'Okwikiriza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Imwe Bagalatia b'abashema 'mwe, n'oha owaabarogire, imwe abaayorekirwe butunu Yesu Kristo abambirwe? <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Reka mbabuuze eki kyonka. Mukaheebwa Omwoyo ahabw'okuhikiiriza Ebiragiro, nari ahabw'okuhurira mukaikiriza? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Nikwo muri abashema mutyo? Mukatandikira omu by'Omwoyo, mbwenu mwahereerukana eby'omubiri? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Obwo busaasi bwingi butyo obu mwagumisiririize, omu mazima bukaba buri obwa busha? <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Mbwenu Ogwo obaha Omwoyo, akakora eby'okutangaaza omuriimwe, abikora ahabw'okuba muhitsya Ebiragiro, nari ahabw'okuhurira mukaikiriza? <verse eid="GAL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Kut 15:6</ref>. </char></note> Nk'oku Abrahamu yaikiriize Ruhanga, okwikiriza okwo kukamubarirwa kuba okuhikiirira; <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />n'ahabw'ekyo mumanye ngu abaine okwikiriza nibo baana ba Abrahamu. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">Kut 12:3</ref>. </char></note> Ebyahandiikirwe, ahabw'okumanya ira ngu Ruhanga aryaiha aha Banyamahanga orubanja ahabw'okwikiriza, bikarangira Abrahamu enkuru nungi, ebyo bitakabaireho, biti: Omuriiwe amahanga goona nimwo gariheerwa omugisha. <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:16">Rom 4:16</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo abaine okwikiriza baheebwa omugisha na Abrahamu owaikiriize.<verse eid="GAL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 27:26">Bir 27:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mumanye ngu boona abeegamira okuhikiiriza Ebiragiro bakiri omu mukyeeno; ahakuba kikahandiikwa ngu: Omuntu weena otarikugumizamu kuhitsya byona ebyahandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'Ebiragiro, akyeenwe. <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:4">Hab 2:4</ref>. </char></note> Kandi nikimanywa ngu tihariho muntu oihwaho orubanja omu maisho ga Ruhanga ahabw'Ebiragiro, ahakuba kikahandiikwa ngu: Ohikiriire aryagira amagara ahabw'okwikiriza; <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lev 18:5</ref>. </char></note> kwonka Ebiragiro tibyegamira kwikiriza, ahakuba kikahandiikwa ngu: orikubihitsya biryamuhaisa amagara. <verse eid="GAL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:23">Bir 21:23</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 5:21">2 Kor 5:21</ref>. </char></note> Kristo akatucungura omu mukyeeno gw'Ebiragiro, obu yaakyeenwa ahabwaitu, ahakuba kikahandiikwa ngu: Omuntu weena orikuhanikwa aha muti akyeenwe: <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />ngu ahabwa Kristo Yesu omugisha ogwahairwe Abrahamu guhikye n'aha Banyamahanga, okwikiriza kubone kutuhaisa Omwoyo owaaraganisiibwe.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />B'eishe-emwe, ka ngambe nk'oku abantu bagamba. Endagaano, nangwa n'obu yaakuba ey'omuntu, ku eheza kuhamibwa, tihariho ondiijo ogiita nari ogyongyeraho. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:18">Kut 22:18</ref>. </char></note> Nimumanya ngu endagaano Ruhanga akaziragaanisa Abrahamu n'omwijukuru. Taragizire ati, abaijukuru nka baingi; kureka akagamba omwe, ati, mwijukuru waawe, niwe Kristo. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:40">Kur 12:40</ref>. </char></note> Ka mbashobororere eki ndikugamba. Endagaano ei Ruhanga yaaraganiise ira, Ebiragiro ebyahairwe bwanyima hahingwireho emyaka magana ana na makumi ashatu tibirikubaasa kugiita, nari okuhindura busha ekyaraganisiibwe. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Ahakuba obuhunguzi, kuri bwahairwe ahabw'Ebiragiro, bukaabaire butakiri bw'okuraganisibwa; kwonka Ruhanga akabuha Abrahamu naamuraganisa. <verse eid="GAL 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:20">Rom 5:20</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu shi, Ebiragiro bikabaho ahabw'enki? Bikongyerwaho ahabw'okushiisha, okuhitsya aha kwija kw'Omwijukuru owaaraganisiibwe omu ndagaano; byakwatsibwa baamaraika, ngu babihe omuteerani. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Kandi omuteerani taba w'omwe, kwonka Ruhanga n'omwe. <verse eid="GAL 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:2-4">Rom 8:2-4</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu ku kiraabe kiri kityo, nimugira ngu Ebiragiro nibihakanisa ebi Ruhanga yaaraganiise? Rubuuza! Ahakuba kuri haabaireho ekiragiro eky'okuhaisa amagara, okuhikiirira kukaatungirwe ahabw'Ebiragiro. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:9-19">Rom 3:9-19</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 11:32">11:32</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Ebyahandiikirwe bikatwarira hamwe byona kutegyekwa ekibi, ngu abarikwikiriza baheebwe ebyaraganisiibwe ahabw'okwikiriza Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Kwonka okwikiriza kutakaizire, tukaba turindirwa omu butegyeki bw'Ebiragiro, tutegyereize okwikiriza okwabaire nikwenda kushuuruurwa. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />N'ahabw'ekyo Ebiragiro bikatubeera omwegyesa w'okutuhitsya ahari Kristo, ngu tubone kwihwaho orubanja ahabw'okwikiriza. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Kwonka mbwenu, nk'oku okwikiriza kwizire, titwakiri mu butegyeki bw'omurezi; <verse eid="GAL 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:12">Yoh 1:12</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba omuri Kristo Yesu mwena muri abaana ba Ruhanga ahabw'okwikiriza. <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:3">Rom 6:3</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 13:14">13:14</ref>. </char></note> Mwena abaabatiziibwe kutaaha omuri Kristo, mukajwara Kristo. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:13">1 Kor 12:13</ref>. </char></note> Tihaakiriho Muyudaaya nari Omugriika, n'obu yaakuba omuhuuku nari ow'obusingye, n'obu yaakuba omushaija nari omukazi; ahakuba mwena muri bamwe omuri Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Kandi ku muraabe muri aba Kristo, biri muri abahunguzi, nk'oku kyaraganisiibwe.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="s1">Oku tuhindurwa abaana ba Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Kwonka ningira nti: Omuhunguzi, ku aba akiri omwana muto, taine ki akiza omuhuuku, n'obu araabe ari mukama wa byona; <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />kureka ategyekwa abarezi n'ababiiki okuhitsya aha bunaku obwaragiirwe ishe. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:1">Gal 5:1</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:20">Kol 2:20</ref>. </char></note> Nikwo naitwe; obu twabaire tukiri abaana bato, tukaba tutegyekwa nk'abahuuku eby'okubandizaho eby'omu nsi egi. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Kwonka obunaku ku bwahikiire kimwe, Ruhanga yaatuma Omwana we, owaazairwe omukazi omu butegyeki bw'Ebiragiro, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:13">Gal 3:13</ref>. </char></note> ngu acungure abaabaire nibategyekwa Ebiragiro, tuheebwe okuhindurwa abaana. <verse eid="GAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:15">Rom 8:15</ref>. </char></note> Kandi imwe, ahabw'okuhinduka abaana, Ruhanga akatuma Omwoyo w'Omwana we omu mitima yaitu, otugambisa ati: Abba, Taata! <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:16">Rom 8:16</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 8:17">17</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu tokiri muhuuku, kureka ori omwana; kandi ku oraabe ori omwana, ori omuhunguzi ahabw'embabazi za Ruhanga.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okugaruka enyima kw'Abagalatia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Haza omu bunaku obwo, obu mwabaire mutarikumanya Ruhanga, mukaba muri abahuuku b'abo, abatari baaruhanga buzima omu buhangwa bwabo; <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />kwonka hati nk'oku muherize kumanya Ruhanga, nari okukira We nk'oku abamanyire, mugarukire muta enyima omu migyenzo ei mwabandiizeho, etaine maani n'obu gwakuba omugasho, okwenda ngu egarukye ebategyekye? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:16">Kol 2:16</ref>. </char></note> Nimugyenza ebiro n'ameezi n'obunaku n'emyaka! <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Nintiina nti, shana byona ebi naabakoreire, nkahendekyera busha.<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Nimbeeshengyereza, B'eishe-emwe, mube nkaanye, ahakuba naanye mbaire nkaimwe. Timurankozire kubi; <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 2:3">1 Kor 2:3</ref>. </char></note> nimumanya ngu endwara y'omu mubiri niyo yandeeteire kubabuurira engiri aha murundi ogw'okubanza; <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />kandi endwara egyo, n'obu eraabe yaabaruhize, timurangayire, n'obu kwakuba okunnuga; kureka mukanyakiira nka maraika wa Ruhanga, nari nka Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Mbwenu okwesiima kwanyu oku mwabaire mwine, hati kuri nkahi? Ahakuba nimpamya ngu, kuri kyabaire nikibaasika, mukaabaire mwihiremu amaisho gaanyu, mugampa. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 5:10">Amo 5:10</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu mpindukire omuzigu waanyu ahabw'okubagambira amazima? <verse eid="GAL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Abo nibabeekundisa, kwonka ti habw'okubendeza ebirungi; kureka nibenda kubakingirana aheeru, ngu mube nibo mwahakwaho. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Mumanye ngu obutoosha bwona ni kirungi okukundwa, kwonka mukundirwe ebirungi, t'obu ndi naimwe bwonka. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:15">1 Kor 4:15</ref>. </char></note> Baana bangye abato, abu ndikugaruka kusaasibwa nk'omukazi orikurumwa, okuhitsya obu Kristo arihangwa omuriimwe! <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />Nkaayenzire kuguma naimwe, n'okworobya aha migambire yangye; ahakuba ebyanyu binshobeire.<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebya Saara na Hagari okumanyisa eby'endagaano ibiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Imwe abarikwenda kutegyekwa Ebiragiro, nimungambire. Timuhurira Ebiragiro? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 16:15">Kut 16:15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 21:2">21:2</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 21:9">9</ref>. </char></note> Nimumanya ku kyahandiikirwe ngu: Abrahamu akaba aine abatabani babiri, omwe akaba ari ow'omuzaana, ondiijo ari ow'omukazi nyeiteeka. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:7-9">Rom 9:7-9</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omwana ow'omuzaana akazaarwa ahabw'okwetenga kw'omubiri, ow'omukazi yaazaarwa ahabw'endagaano. <verse eid="GAL 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Ebyo biri nk'enfumu, ahakuba abakazi abo nibamanyisa endagaano ibiri, emwe ekaruga aha rushozi Sinai, eyaazaire abaana ab'obuhuuku, niwe Hagari; <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />mbwenu Hagari ogwo naashushanisibwa nk'orushozi Sinai orw'omuri Buharabu, orurikugyeranisibwa na Yerusaalemu ekiriho na hati; ahakuba ari omu buhuuku hamwe n'abaana be. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Kwonka Yerusaalemu ey'omu iguru niwe mukazi nyeiteeka, kandi niwe maaweitwe. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:1">Isa 54:1</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba kikahandiikwa ngu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Shemererwa, iwe engumba etazaara!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Imutsya eiraka, oteere akaari, iwe otarumwa kuzaara;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Ahakuba abaana b'enyangwakazi nibakira ab'enkundwakazi.<verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Mbwenu itwe, B'eishe-emwe, turi abaana b'endagaano nka Isaaka. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:9-12">Kut 21:9-12</ref>. </char></note> Kandi nk'owaazairwe ahabw'okwetenga kw'omubiri omu biro ebyo oku yaahiigire owaazairwe ahabw'Omwoyo, nikwo kiri na hati. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Beitu Ebyahandiikirwe bigira bita? Biti: Binga omuzaana n'omwana we; ahakuba omwana w'omuzaana tarihungura n'ow'omukazi nyeiteeka. <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Mbwenu, B'eishe-emwe, tituri baana b'omuzaana, kureka ab'omukazi nyeiteeka.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s1">Okuhamya obusingye bw'Obukristaayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 15:10">Byak 15:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kristo akatubohoorora ngu tugire obusingye; n'ahabw'ekyo mwemerere muhamire, mutagaruka mu nkomo y'obuhuuku.<verse eid="GAL 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Reeba, nyowe Paulo nimbagambira nti: Ku muraikirize kusharwa, Kristo naaba atakibainiire mugasho. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Ningaruka kuhamiza omuntu weena orisharwa, nti: Aine eibanja ry'okuhitsya ebiragiro byona. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Imwe abarikwenda kwihwaho orubanja ahabw'Ebiragiro, mwecwire ahari Kristo, mwagwa mwaruga omu mbabazi. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Kwonka itwe, ahabw'Omwoyo n'ahabw'okwikiriza kwaitu tutegyereize, kandi twine amatsiko g'okuheebwa okuhikiirira. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 6:15">Gal 6:15</ref>. </char></note> Mumanye ngu omuri Kristo Yesu okusharwa tikwine mugasho, n'obu kwakuba okutasharwa; ekiine omugasho buzima n'okwikiriza okurikukoresibwa okukunda. <verse eid="GAL 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Ka mwabaire nimugyenda gye; n'oha owaabazibiire kworobera amazima? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Okwohibwa oku tikurarugire ahari Ogwo owaabeetsire. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 5:6">1 Kor 5:6</ref>. </char></note> Ekitumbisa kikye kitumbya ekiihuro kyona. <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Nyowe nimbeesiga omuri Mukama ku mutariikiriza bindi ebitari byangye; kwonka ogwo orikubarabanisamu aryagyibwaho orubanja. <verse eid="GAL 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:23">1 Kor 1:23</ref>. </char></note> Beitu B'eishe-emwe, ku ndaabe ninkibuurira eby'okusharwa, ahabw'enki ninkihiigwa? Obwo enkongi y'omusharaba neeba eihirweho. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Nkaayenzire ngu abo abarikubarabanisamu babarugyemu.<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 2:16">1 Pet 2:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> B'eishe-emwe, mukeetwa ngu mugire obusingye; kwonka obusingye obu mutabuhindura orwekwatso rw'okukora eby'okwetenga kw'omubiri, kureka okukunda kubagyeme kuheerezana. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Ahakuba Ebiragiro bihikiirizibwa omu kigambo kimwe eki ngu: Kunda mutaahi waawe, nk'oku oyekunda. <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Kwonka ku muraabe nimurumana, mwaryana, mwerinde mutamaranaho.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Emirimo y'obuzaarwa bw'omubiri n'ebyana by'Omwoyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Kwonka nyowe ningira nti: Mugume mugyendere omu Mwoyo; obwo nibwo mutarihikiiriza eby'okwetenga kw'omubiri; <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 7:15">Rom 7:15</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 7:23">23</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba omubiri gurwanisa Omwoyo, kandi n'Omwoyo arwanisa omubiri; ahabw'okuba ebyo byombi birwanisana; n'ahabw'ekyo timurikubaasa kukora ki murikwenda. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:14">Rom 8:14</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ku mwebemberwa Omwoyo, muba mutakitegyekwa Biragiro. <verse eid="GAL 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Mbwenu emirimo y'obuzaarwa bw'omubiri neemanywa, niyo egi: obushambani, ebirikwitsa enshoni, okurigira okubi, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />okuramya ebishushani, okuroga, obuzigu, okurwana, eihari, ekiniga, empaka, okwebaganisamu, okurwanira orubaju, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:5">Efe 5:5</ref>. </char></note> okwangirana, obusinzi, okuraara enkyera, n'ebindi nk'ebyo. Nimbateisa, nk'oku naabateisize ira, nti: Abarikukora nk'ebyo tibarihungura bukama bwa Ruhanga. <verse eid="GAL 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Kwonka ebyana by'Omwoyo nibyo ebi: okukunda, okushemererwa, obusingye, okugumisiriza, embabazi, oburungi, obwesigwa, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 1:9">1 Tim 1:9</ref>. </char></note> obucureezi, n'okwerinda; ebiri nk'ebyo tihariho kiragiro ekirikubizibira. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:6">Rom 6:6</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:5">Kol 3:5</ref>. </char></note> Kandi abo aba Kristo Yesu bakabamba aha musharaba omubiri n'emize yaagwo n'okwetenga kwagwo. <verse eid="GAL 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Ku turaabe turiho ahabw'Omwoyo, ka tugyendere omu Mwoyo. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:3">Fil 2:3</ref>. </char></note> Turekye kwehimbisiza ahari busha, n'obu kwakuba okugwisana kubi, nari okugirirana amahari.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s1">Okugarura abagwire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 18:15">Mat 18:15</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 5:19">Yak 5:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> B'eishe-emwe, omuntu ku araagwe omu kibi kyona, imwe ab'Omwoyo mumugarure n'omutima gw'obucureezi; omuntu weena omuriimwe ayerinde atategwa nkawe. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Muhwerahwerane emitwaro yaanyu, mubone kuhikiiriza mutyo ekiragiro kya Kristo. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Ahakuba omuntu orikweteekateekaho ngu n'ekintu, haza kunu ataine ku ari, naaba naayebeiha. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 13:5">2 Kor 13:5</ref>. </char></note> Ekirungi nikwo omuntu weena kugyeza omurimo gwe, akaba nigwo yaayehimbisizamu, kutari kwehimbisiza mu gwa mutaahi we. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Ahabw'okuba omuntu weena aryayekorera omutwaro gwe wenka.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omuntu okugyesha eki abibire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 9:14">1 Kor 9:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Orikwegyesibwa ekigambo ahe orikumwegyesa aha birungi byona, bakwataniise. <verse eid="GAL 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Mutabeihwebeihwa; Ruhanga tagaaniizibwa; ahakuba ebi omuntu abiba nibyo agyesha. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:13">Rom 8:13</ref>. </char></note> Orikubibira omubiri gwe, omuri ogwo mubiri nimwo arigyesha okujunda; kwonka orikubibira Omwoyo, omu Mwoyo ogwo nimwo arigyesha amagara agatahwaho. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 3:13">2 Tes 3:13</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu nu turekye kuruha omu kukora gye; ahakuba obunaku ku burihika, turyagyesha, ku turiba tutarikuhwa matsiko. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />N'ahabw'ekyo, obu tukiine omwanya, tukore gye abantu boona, kwonka okukira munonga abari omu nju y'okwikiriza.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Mureebe enyuguta oku ziri mpango, ezi naabahandiikira n'omukono gwangye nyenka. <verse eid="GAL 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:11">Gal 5:11</ref>. </char></note> Boona abarikwenda kweyoreka ku bari gye omu by'omubiri, nibo babagyema kusharwa; babikunda ngu barekye kuhiigwa ahabw'omusharaba gwa Kristo. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Kandi hoona n'abasharwa tibahitsya Biragiro; kwonka benda ngu musharwe, babone kwehimbisa ahabw'emibiri yaanyu. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 2:2">1 Kor 2:2</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka nyowe tindikwenda kwehimbisa habw'ekintu kyona, kureka ahabw'omusharaba gwa Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo, ogwareeteire ensi ahariinye kuba ebambirwe, kandi naanye ahariyo kuba obambirwe. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 3:3">Fil 3:3</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba okusharwa ti kintu, n'obu kwakuba okutasharwa, kureka okuhinduka ekihangirwe kisya. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Kandi boona abarikukuratira okuhabura oku, nibo Baisraeli ba Ruhanga, bagire obusingye n'okusaasirwa.<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 4:10">2 Kor 4:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okuruga hati hatarigira owaagaruka kundusya, ahabw'okuba nyine enkojo za Yesu aha mubiri gwangye.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />B'eishe-emwe, embabazi za Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo zigume n'emyoyo yaanyu. Amiina.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>